('lovers', 3, 'What is a doubt about us you have not said out loud?', '¿Qué duda sobre nosotros no has dicho en voz alta?'),
('lovers', 3, 'What is a summer in your past you are still trying to get over?', '¿Qué verano de tu pasado todavía intentas superar?'),
('lovers', 3, 'When were you most insecure about me this summer?', '¿Cuándo sentiste más inseguridad por mí este verano?'),
